  // 按分类自动整齐排序：常规食谱 -> 稀有食谱 -> 传说食谱 -> 扭蛋秘方单独排在最后（SR 在前、SSR 在后）
  const getRecipeSortRank = (r) => {
    if (r.gachaOnly) return r.gachaTier === 'SSR' ? 5 : 4;
    if (r.rarity === 'legend') return 3;
    if (r.rarity === 'rare') return 2;
    return 1;
  };
  PUP_KITCHEN_RECIPES.sort((a, b) => {
    const ra = getRecipeSortRank(a);
    const rb = getRecipeSortRank(b);
    if (ra !== rb) return ra - rb;
    return (a.diff || 1) - (b.diff || 1);
  });

